  "description": {
   "en": "1. Romance hidden in the leaves\n\nA frivolous samurai's apprentice find his way into the heart of his prim \u0026 tenacious ronin sensei.\n\n2. The road through dreams\n\nA 16 year old nobleman is in love with his childhood friend, a servant in his family house, but the latter can't return his feeling because of their class difference.\n\n3. Sign of a world's love\n\nBefore Commodore Calbraith left Japan, he picked the most beautiful flower of the Orient...\n\n4. Odoru Awa ni Tama no Hada\n\nA young sensei from Tokyo is appointed as a teacher in a remote fishing village's school. His young but tough students are giving him a hard time, especially the bossy son of the head of the village.\n\n5. Gentle Darkness\n\nSince his family moved recently to a Western mansion, a spoiled rich youngster has had to live in a western life style that he hates. While wandering in his new family's estate, he came across a strange house, but it seems that the person who lived there is even stranger...\n\n6. Shirayuki no Sono Mune ni\n\nRomance hidden in the leaves (1) Omake (deals mainly in the second couple in the story)."
  },
